title: The Democratic Convention
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: pres_year = 1 and month = 7 and convention_done != year
priority: 250

= The Democratic Convention

Delegates gather for the party's national convention. The platform is a battlefield: progressives want bold commitments, moderates want caution, labor wants trade protections, and everyone wants unity.

- @platform_bold: A bold platform
- @platform_balanced: A balanced platform
- @platform_unity: A unity convention

@platform_bold
on-arrival: convention_done = year; progressive_dissent -= 6; moderate_dissent += 4; left_relation += 5; farleft_strength -= 1; suburban_dem -= 1*(1-dissent); young_dem += 2*(1-dissent); dem_enthusiasm += 0.4

The platform embraces ambitious commitments. The left is pleased.

@platform_balanced
on-arrival: convention_done = year; progressive_dissent += 1; moderate_dissent -= 1; labor_dissent -= 1; suburban_dem += 1*(1-dissent)

A carefully negotiated platform offends few and thrills fewer.

@platform_unity
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Need 1 resource.
on-arrival: convention_done = year; progressive_dissent -= 3; moderate_dissent -= 3; labor_dissent -= 3; populist_dissent -= 3; establishment_dissent -= 3; abundance_dissent -= 3; resources -= 1

Speakers across the spectrum embrace each other onstage. The show of unity helps.
